    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Synaptic Nexus",
    "summary": "As a battle round opens, you may activate one unused Synaptic Imperative. For that round, your **TYRANIDS** units benefit while in [Synapse Range](vsdata:ability/tyranids.synapse) of any Synapse unit in your army. **Synaptic Augmentation** gives their models an invulnerable save of 5+. **Surging Vitality** adds 1 when they roll to Advance or Charge. **Goaded to Slaughter** gives their models +1 to Hit with [melee attacks](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks).",
